ned when the battle starts sooner than he expected.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nQILvEzK20RPtLHsXWBfK9k7Ges.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nQILvEzK20RPtLHsXWBfK9k7Ges.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34765/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"791739","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Bullied by her classmates because of her mother's questionable occupation, Mako \"Nakama\" Nakarai, after being chosen to engage into the sixth round, resorts to extremes to arrange money enough to complete a personal project of hers in time.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iRhuBuvXA9wfZ78E6U6MwgbUdV7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iRhuBuvXA9wfZ78E6U6MwgbUdV7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34765/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"791740","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Nagi, a childhood friend of Kunihiko Moji's needs a heart transplant, but so far the only compatible donor found is Moji himself. While dealing with Nagi's drama, he is selected to fight the seventh enemy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pqj4f7JuxhwbhGZDoqfIIGQSI8D.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pqj4f7JuxhwbhGZDoqfIIGQSI8D.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34765/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"791741","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Maki Ano is in awe as her foster 