 proposal from Dung Beetle that may save his life if he accepts.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/19U3JQrCnOflGCcjyvDBMPmhZPQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/19U3JQrCnOflGCcjyvDBMPmhZPQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34765/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"791751","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Jun takes Kana to her father's house, having Machi traveling with them. On the way, he reminisces about his infancy days, and later, he asks Machi's help to protect Kana from Dung Beetle's intentions.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-09-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9gpSq9I8PBaD4WX6hVXvCgKPyYq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9gpSq9I8PBaD4WX6hVXvCgKPyYq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34765/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"791752","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The human armies decide to intervene during the thirteenth battle, while Machi betrays Dung Beetle and becomes the next pilot in Kana's place.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-09-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3ITN66JhvwAXw81ewyREdWoMYR1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3ITN66JhvwAXw81ewyREdWoMYR1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34765/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"791753","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Jun declines Seki's offer and becomes the pilot for the final round. During the long battle, he reminisces about his fallen 